  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 425°F (220°C).",
    "Season the duck breast with salt and black pepper.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together gochujang, sesame oil, gochugaru, soy sauce, brown sugar, garlic, and ginger.",
    "Place the duck breast in a shallow dish and brush both sides with the marinade mixture.",
    "Arrange the duck breast on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper and bake for 20 minutes.",
    "While the duck is baking, prepare the hot stone plate by heating it in the oven for 5 minutes.",
    "Remove the duck from the oven and let it rest for 5 minutes before slicing.",
    "To assemble the dish, place the sliced duck on the hot stone plate, garnish with green onions, toasted sesame seeds, and cilantro.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
  ],
